    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'We walked together, the laughter and drumming from the festival buzzing
    in my head as out steps synchronized. We passed a row of ice sculptures. They
    were as magnificent as Megari had said: tigers and butterflies, dragon boats
    and empresses wearing phoenix crowns, even a replica of the imperial palace.
    I couldn''t choose a favorite. Page 364'
